From b281bfe518746696392a258aa6250cb4cac071c4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Charles Hoskinson <charles.hoskinson@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 12 Nov 2026 07:48:25 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] E1: relax the base field from PrimeField64 to PrimeField

sample_bits takes the low bits of the canonical representative, grinding
iterates 0..min(p, 2^64), the proof decoder refuses values that do not fit
usize, and base_field_order is computed from the BigUint order. BabyBear
proofs are byte-identical (e1_bb_bytes) and the 239 suite tests pass.
